Mostafizur Rahman and a notice under Section 26(1) of the Anti-
Corruption Commission Act, 2004 was served upon her to furnish the 
statement of her assets and in compliance with the said notice, she 
submitted her statement of assets on 14.05.20215 stating that she 
acquired total assets of Tk. 1,71,03,045. P.W. 5 Md. Harunur Rashid and 
P.W. 6 Engineer Md. Abdul Mottalib submitted the assessment report of 
