         Mr. Md. Manirul Islam Miah, Advocate 
           …. For the petitioner 
 
             
        Mr. Kh. Bahar Rumy, D.A.G. with 
         Mr. Nur Muhammad Azami, D.A.G. with 
        Mr. Md. Abdul Jabbar Joel, A.A.G. with 
