Considering all these aspects of this case, we find that the order 
of their refusing the issue of registration certificate of the petitioner is 
arbitrarily and malafidy. Moreover the annexure K to the writ petition 
also reflected that a lot of CNG Auto rickshaw is now flying in the road 
having no registration certificate but the BRTA is not in a position to 
