Shahjahan Mia (Md) Vs. Government of Bangladesh and 
others, 20 BLC (HCD) 539; Md. Mostafa Kamal Vs. The 
Government 
of 
the 
People’s 
Republic 
of 
Bangladesh 
represented by the Secretary, Ministry of Education and 
