In the matter of: 
An application under Section 115(1) of the Code of Civil 
Procedure. 
  
And 
Md. Razib Al Hassan @ Anik 
  
 
 
 
... Petitioner 
  
-Versus- 
Most. Jahanara Begum and another 
  
 
 
 
